{"id":"550b3a6a7be23842","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Locally Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top5 Locally Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top5 Locally Compact Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space — ZFC Top5 Locally Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology\">58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,x,U,K,\\sigma\">\\(X,\\tau,x,U,K,\\sigma\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\)</span> (open set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\)</span> (subspace-topology predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U,K,\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,K,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(K,\\sigma)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U,K,\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,K,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(K,\\sigma)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient topology is required even when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is empty.  Compactness is tested on a witnessed subspace topology, not on an unregistered inline family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space","status":"resolved","id":"06b5f03f1e28a63b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"694a41b0cb75249b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S$ (open set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space","status":"resolved","id":"06b5f03f1e28a63b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S$ (compactness predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,x,U,K,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}locally\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U,K,\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\land x\\in U\\land U\\subseteq K\\subseteq X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,K,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(K,\\sigma)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1520,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f2943d50508785c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3593","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space.md|58-df-zfc-top5-locally-compact-space]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["74086485fba8d86f","473439958a92cf5b","06b5f03f1e28a63b","694a41b0cb75249b"]}